// GENERATED by tools/gen_vk_binding.py from the table there; do not edit.
// No C++ counterpart: the Vulkan 1.2 API (vulkan/vulkan.h) and GLFW's
// Vulkan entry points that vulkan_rhi, ugui_impl_vulkan and the examples
// call, declared by hand. Layouts are C's (`extern struct`), field names
// are snake_case without Vulkan's p/pp/pfn pointer prefixes, and every
// field defaults to zero/null, so `VkFooCreateInfo { ... }` is C++'s
// `VkFooCreateInfo ci{VK_STRUCTURE_TYPE_FOO_CREATE_INFO}` (s_type defaults
// to the struct's own type). Constant values and the layouts were taken
// from vulkan.h by the generator and are checked by
// tests/vulkan_layout_test.aki. 64-bit targets only (non-dispatchable
// handles are u64).

